ño glacial.\nLa habilidad se considera de lanza desaforada.\nDurante la ejecución de la habilidad, la agente se vuelve invulnerable."}],"atributos":[{"clave":"Apoyo rápido: Centinela de hierro","valores":["Nivel 1","Nivel 2","Nivel 3","Nivel 4","Nivel 5","Nivel 6","Nivel 7","Nivel 8","Nivel 9","Nivel 10","Nivel 11","Nivel 12","Nivel 13","Nivel 14","Nivel 15","Nivel 16"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de daño","valores":["39.7%","43.4%","47.1%","50.8%","54.5%","58.2%","61.9%","65.6%","69.3%","73%","76.7%","80.4%","84.1%","87.8%","91.5%","95.2%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento","valores":["31.2%","32.7%","34.2%","35.7%","37.2%","38.7%","40.2%","41.7%","43.2%","44.7%","46.2%","47.7%","49.2%","50.7%","52.2%","53.7%"]},{"clave":"","valores":["","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]},{"clave":"Apoyo defensivo: Frío implacable","valores":["Nivel 1","Nivel 2","Nivel 3","Nivel 4","Nivel 5","Nivel 6","Nivel 7","Nivel 8","Nivel 9","Nivel 10","Nivel 11","Nivel 12","Nivel 13","Nivel 14","Nivel 15","Nivel 16"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento defensivo ligero","valores":["271.3%","283.7%","296.1%","308.5%","320.9%","333.3%","345.7%","358.1%","370.5%","382.9%","395.3%","407.7%","420.1%","432.5%","444.9%","457.3%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento defensivo fuerte","valores":["342.8%","358.4%","374%","389.6%","405.2%","420.8%","436.4%","452%","467.6%","483.2%","498.8%","514.4%","530%","545.6%","561.2%","576.8%"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de Aturdimiento defensivo continuo","valores":["166.8%","174.4%","182%","189.6%","197.2%","204.8%","212.4%","220%","227.6%","235.2%","242.8%","250.4%","258%","265.6%","273.2%","280.8%"]},{"clave":"","valores":["","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]},{"clave":"Ataque sucesivo: Escarcha devoradora","valores":["Nivel 1","Nivel 2","Nivel 3","Nivel 4","Nivel 5","Nivel 6","Nivel 7","Nivel 8","Nivel 9","Nivel 10","Nivel 11","Nivel 12","Nivel 13","Nivel 14","Nivel 15","Nivel 16"]},{"clave":"Multiplicador de daño","valor